s10-3-p12 : Block
s10-3-p12 = prose (cons "Local knowledge is therefore a construction over partial observation. A peer can prove an action safe for every state compatible with its observations without possessing the global state. This supplies a precise setting for local invariants, distributed verification, and computation through message exchange. More elaborate protocols can express obligations, receipts, debt transfer, or cancellation in the same language, provided their transitions are defined." nil)
